sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner
    participant Control as Trusted controller
    participant Remote as Authorized worker supervisor
    participant Task as Isolated reviewed task
    Owner->>Control: Explicitly approve remote profile and data scope
    Control->>Remote: Scoped job with attempt, expiry and input digest
    Remote->>Remote: Validate job identity, scope and digest
    Remote->>Task: Execute reviewed task under quotas
    Task-->>Remote: Bounded artifacts
    Remote-->>Control: Return attempt outcome and resource evidence
    Control->>Control: Verify current fence, hashes and trusted evaluation
